<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX index closes PSE session down 17 points.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX index closes PSE session down 17 points.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Reuters RPIX index closed Tuesday's session on the Prague Stock Exchange down 17 points at 1,112.</p>
<p>*Six of the seven continuously traded issues lose ground, led by SPT Telecom which fell 52 crowns.</p>
<p>*Turnover 11.9 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
